  "build_note": "Source-built from the pinned PyYAML 6.0.3 sdist (Cython 3.3.1 generates _yaml.c from the pinned _yaml.pyx) with PYYAML_FORCE_LIBYAML=1, clang -O0 and LLVM source coverage, linked against a static PIC libyaml 0.2.5 built from the pinned tarball with the same coverage flags. The image checks that the installed yaml/*.py equal the sdist lib/yaml, that the extension has no libyaml shared-library dependency and that _yaml.get_version_string() is 0.2.5. The official aarch64 cp314 wheel compiles the same sources optimised and stripped.",
  "dependencies_note": "No runtime dependencies; Cython and setuptools are build backend only.",
